@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title First journey (proposed; no imports or graph for the farmer)

|Farmer|
start
:Select a prepared behavior;
:Review plain-language requirements;
:Confirm farm / installation facts;
:Apply;
if (Result?) then (accepted)
  :Specific accepted result;
else (blocked)
  :Specific blocker\n+ next action;
endif
|Engineer / installer|
:Open the same incident;
:See technical evidence\n(source, revision, instance,\ninputs, constraint, run, binding);
stop
@enduml
